---
description:
globs:
alwaysApply: true
Use TypeScript for all files. Never use any type, always define proper interfaces.

Use React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS for frontend. Node.js + Express + Socket.IO for backend.

For OpenAI Realtime API always use: temperature: 0.2, seed: 12345, model: "gpt-4o-realtime-preview" for consistency.

Implement Voice Activity Detection with configurable parameters: threshold, minSpeechDuration, maxSilenceDuration.

Create these exact tools for OpenAI function calling: advance_question, evaluate_answer, start_competition, end_competition, answer_zero_waste_question, handle_unclear_input. Each tool must have detailed Turkish descriptions.

Never use emojis or icons in prompts. Keep prompts clean, professional, and in Turkish only.

Use WebSocket for client-backend communication and OpenAI Realtime API WebSocket for backend-OpenAI communication.

Store session data in Redis with pattern: session:{participantId}. Support max 100 concurrent sessions.

Implement audio streaming with MediaRecorder API, 100ms chunks, base64 encoding.

Handle connection drops with 5 retry attempts using exponential backoff.

Always validate user input and implement proper error handling for all API calls.

